    "updated_at": "2016-01-09T19:41:13Z",
    "body": "Ah, apparently we do fire the event, but we simply don't show the dialog if the event wants us to; instead we act as if the user had selected \"leave the page\".  It's possible the spec already allows this, since it says \"then the user agent should ask the user to confirm\", emphasis on \"should\".\n",
